{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27620","headline":"秋夜登润州慈和寺上方 · 张祜","name":"秋夜登润州慈和寺上方","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清夜浮埃暂歇鄽，塔轮金照露华鲜。\n人行中路月生海，鹤语上方星满天。\n楼影半连深岸水，钟声寒彻远林烟。\n僧房闭尽下楼去，一半梦魂离世缘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27620.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27620","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}